2. Free personal local use

An individual may download, make private copies of, install and run the Software
without a license fee solely for that individual's personal, non-commercial use
on devices they own or control. Private modifications necessary to install,
configure or maintain that local installation are permitted for the same purpose.
Keep this license and applicable copyright notices with those copies.

The local installation must serve only that individual. Making it available as
a hosted service, shared workspace or service for another person is not covered
by this grant, whether or not anyone is charged. Using an external inference
API from an otherwise permitted local installation is allowed; the API's own
terms and fees remain separate.

